    },
    "GPU load": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU-Last"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gated models such as Llama or Gemma need a token, after you accept their licence on the model page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesperrte Modelle wie Llama oder Gemma brauchen einen Token, nachdem du auf der Modellseite deren Lizenz zugestimmt hast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allgemein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give it an https address before it is reachable from the internet: in Coolify, set a domain for the service; elsewhere, put a reverse proxy such as Caddy in front of it. After pairing, Podlight offers to bring this Mac's RunPod key, rules and models along.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib ihm eine https-Adresse, bevor er aus dem Internet erreichbar ist: In Coolify trägst du eine Domain für den Dienst ein, sonst stellst du einen Reverse Proxy wie Caddy davor. Nach dem Koppeln bietet Podlight an, RunPod-Schlüssel, Regeln und Modelle dieses Macs mitzunehmen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good first choices for coding:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gut für den Anfang beim Programmieren:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half the memory, more room for context, and usually faster: measured twice as fast on the same card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halber Speicher, mehr Platz für Kontext und meist schneller: Auf derselben Karte doppelt so schnell gemessen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hand Over to Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Server übergeben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Handing over %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wird übergeben …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosting for new models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hosting für neue Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do I set up a server?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie richte ich einen Server ein?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not be reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face ist nicht erreichbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not be reached. Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfe die Internetverbindung und versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not describe the model, so it cannot be taken over yet: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face konnte das Modell nicht beschreiben, deshalb lässt es sich noch nicht übernehmen: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face does not accept this token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face akzeptiert diesen Token nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging-Face-Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face token (recommended)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging-Face-Token (empfohlen)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I Use a Podlight Server…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich nutze einen Podlight-Server …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry. Then pick %@/<name> with /models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steht schon etwas in der Datei, übernimm nur den Eintrag „providers“. Wähle dann %@/<Name> mit /models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry. Then pick the model with /model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hat die Datei schon Inhalt, ergänze nur den Eintrag „providers“. Wähle dann mit /model das Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Images": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bilder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your coding agent (OpenCode, Cline, Aider, pi, …) choose a custom or OpenAI-compatible provider and enter these three values. A stopped model starts by itself when an agent asks for it; a new pod then needs up to 25 minutes, so start a new model in Podlight first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle in deinem Coding-Agenten (OpenCode, Cline, Aider, pi, …) einen eigenen oder OpenAI-kompatiblen Anbieter und trage diese drei Werte ein. Ein gestopptes Modell startet von selbst, wenn ein Agent es anfragt. Ein neuer Pod braucht dann bis zu 25 Minuten, starte ein neues Modell deshalb zuerst in Podlight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include anonymized": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anonymisierte einbeziehen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install with one command": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit einem Befehl installieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %lld minutes, and by itself if the server %@ is unreachable for more than %lld minutes. It keeps running when this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits. You can extend it while it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er stoppt früher, wenn %1$lld Minuten lang keine Anfragen kommen, und von selbst, wenn der Server %2$@ länger als %3$lld Minuten nicht erreichbar ist. Schläft dieser Mac oder wird Podlight beendet, läuft er weiter. Du kannst ihn verlängern, während er läuft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %1$lld minutes, and by itself if the server %2$@ is unreachable for more than %3$lld minutes. It keeps running when this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits. You can extend it while it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %lld minutes, and by itself if this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits for more than %lld minutes. You can extend it while it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er stoppt früher, wenn %1$lld Minuten lang keine Anfrage kommt, und von selbst, wenn dieser Mac schläft oder Podlight länger als %2$lld Minuten beendet ist. Solange er läuft, kannst du verlängern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %1$lld minutes, and by itself if this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits for more than %2$lld minutes. You can extend it while it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weiter warten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep model on disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell zwischenspeichern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept disks (%lld GB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behaltene Festplatten (%lld GB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept disks of stopped models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
