    "Nothing is billed while the model is stopped. Each start downloads the model again, which takes 10–25 minutes. Keeping it on disk would cost %@ while stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im gestoppten Zustand fallen keine Kosten an. Jeder Start lädt das Modell neu herunter, das dauert 10–25 Minuten. Auf der Festplatte behalten würde im gestoppten Zustand %@ kosten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is deleted at Venice; you can add the model again at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
